    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In &quot;Pet Oddities: Desktop Shelter&quot;, you\u2019ll use an ancient book to collect all kinds of cute, weird, funny, and uniquely styled creatures \u2014 until you find the oldest one and become the ultimate keeper!The game will keep getting updates! Yep, seriously \u2014 we\u2019ll be updating it regularly!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3746450/extras/d2308b7ea4a89ac4fd84d689c8243a42.avif?t=1747995341\" width=800 height=250 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect all sorts of ancient creatures \u2014 and don\u2019t worry, we\u2019ll be adding even more in future updates!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3746450/extras/449edc661d947c6c2156d3ec5a479414.poster.avif?t=1747995341\" width=800 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3746450/extras/449edc661d947c6c2156d3ec5a479414.webm?t=1747995341\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3746450/extras/449edc661d947c6c2156d3ec5a479414.mp4?t=1747995341\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3746450/extras/2354160d0b5ca5babe6e5e452d4e9348.avif?t=1747995341\" width=800 height=250 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >These creatures can even produce unexpected and ancient treasures\u2026 which might sell for a pretty good price!<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3746450/extras/f398161048745a75eb46d1fa5080814a.poster.avif?t=1747995341\" width=800 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3746450/extras/f398161048745a75eb46d1fa5080814a.webm?t=1747995341\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3746450/extras/f398161048745a75eb46d1fa5080814a.mp4?t=1747995341\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3746450/extras/719643404f0774cad1bea508440f9e9d.avif?t=1747995341\" width=800 height=250 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Zooming and hiding options make the gameplay more fun and flexible.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3746450/extras/1da010cd4b6b46a366f9bdccf631186b.poster.avif?t=1747995341\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3746450/extras/1da010cd4b6b46a366f9bdccf631186b.webm?t=1747995341\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3746450/extras/1da010cd4b6b46a366f9bdccf631186b.mp4?t=1747995341\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3746450/extras/1b80e44cf4b7b7ac9cf062f2349fb202.poster.avif?t=1747995341\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3746450/extras/1b80e44cf4b7b7ac9cf062f2349fb202.webm?t=1747995341\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3746450/extras/1b80e44cf4b7b7ac9cf062f2349fb202.mp4?t=1747995341\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3746450/extras/8dd12839e9527ca9a0a1ee716aa9fd6c.avif?t=1747995341\" width=800 height=250 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Items and creatures you collect will be shown in your collection gallery \u2014 giving you that awesome feeling of progress!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3746450/extras/478a4f9505ba1ce1d01301ea30994138.poster.avif?t=1747995341\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3746450/extras/478a4f9505ba1ce1d01301ea30994138.webm?t=1747995341\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3746450/extras/478a4f9505ba1ce1d01301ea30994138.mp4?t=1747995341\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3746450/extras/f9da6a891a80966ce9bb82a54c4a2bc8.avif?t=1747995341\" width=800 height=250 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Creature box doesn't fit the screen?<br>\u2192 Try setting your screen resolution to <strong>1920\u00d71080</strong> for the best experience. </p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In &quot;Pet Oddities: Desktop Shelter&quot;, you\u2019ll use an ancient book to collect all kinds of cute, weird, funny, and uniquely styled creatures \u2014 until you find the oldest one and become the ultimate keeper!The game will keep getting updates! Yep, seriously \u2014 we\u2019ll be updating it regularly!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3746450/extras/d2308b7ea4a89ac4fd84d689c8243a42.avif?t=1747995341\" width=800 height=250 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect all sorts of ancient creatures \u2014 and don\u2019t worry, we\u2019ll be adding even more in future updates!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3746450/extras/449edc661d947c6c2156d3ec5a479414.poster.avif?t=1747995341\" width=800 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3746450/extras/449edc661d947c6c2156d3ec5a479414.webm?t=1747995341\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3746450/extras/449edc661d947c6c2156d3ec5a479414.mp4?t=1747995341\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3746450/extras/2354160d0b5ca5babe6e5e452d4e9348.avif?t=1747995341\" width=800 height=250 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >These creatures can even produce unexpected and ancient treasures\u2026 which might sell for a pretty good price!<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/